{"title": "Protest at Jantar Mantar Turns Violent as Woman Throws Ink at CJP Founder", "summary": "A woman threw an ink-like liquid at CJP founder Abhijeet Dipke during a protest at Jantar Mantar, where he was on hunger strike. The incident occurred after police took away another protester, Sonam Wangchuk, to the hospital. The CJP founder has been on hunger strike for 20 days, demanding justice for Wangchuk.", "summary_points": ["A woman threw an ink-like liquid at Abhijeet Dipke during a protest at Jantar Mantar.", "The incident occurred after police took away Sonam Wangchuk to the hospital.", "Abhijeet Dipke has been on hunger strike for 20 days, demanding justice for Wangchuk.", "The CJP founder claims that he was detained and assaulted by Delhi police after Wangchuk was removed from the protest site.", "The incident highlights the tensions between the CJP and the government over the treatment of protesters."], "title_hi": "जंतर मंतर में हिंसक प्रदर्शन, महिला ने अभिजीत दिपक को इंकर की तरह फेंका", "summary_hi": "जंतर मंतर में हिंसक प्रदर्शन, महिला ने अभिजीत दिपक को इंकर की तरह फेंका, जिसमें पुलिस ने सोनम वांगचुक को अस्पताल ले जाने के बाद यह घटना घटी।", "summary_points_hi": ["महिला ने अभिजीत दिपक को इंकर की तरह फेंका जंतर मंतर में हिंसक प्रदर्शन में।", "पुलिस ने सोनम वांगचुक को अस्पताल ले जाने के बाद यह घटना घटी।", "अभिजीत दिपक 20 दिनों से हड़ताल पर हैं, जिसमें उन्होंने सोनम वांगचुक की मांग में न्याय की मांग की है।", "अभिजीत दिपक का दावा है कि पुलिस ने उन्हें गिरफ्तार कर लिया और उन पर हमला किया।", "यह घटना प्रदर्शनकारियों और सरकार के बीच तनाव को दर्शाती है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets emphasize the violence and police brutality, while also highlighting the CJP founder's hunger strike as a form of protest. They often use words like 'hate crime' to describe the incident.", "center": "Centrist coverage focuses on the facts of the incident, including the woman's actions and the police response. They may also mention the CJP founder's hunger strike, but in a more neutral tone.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets frame the incident as an example of 'fake news' and 'media bias', claiming that the CJP founder is trying to manipulate public opinion. They often use language like 'hysteria' and 'overreaction'."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वामपंथी समाचारों में घटना को हिंसा और पुलिस दुर्व्यवहार के रूप में उजागर किया जाता है, साथ ही साथ CJP संस्थापक की हड़ताल को एक प्रदर्शन के रूप में बताया जाता है।", "center": "केंद्रीय समाचारों में घटना के तथ्यों पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया जाता है, जिसमें महिला की कार्रवाई और पुलिस की प्रतिक्रिया शामिल है। वे CJP संस्थापक की हड़ताल को भी एक निष्पक्ष तरीके से बताते हैं।", "right": "वामपंथी समाचारों में घटना को 'हisterिया' और 'अनुप्रास' के रूप में प्रस्तुत किया जाता है।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132476641,imgsize-20554889.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/video-woman-hurls-ink-at-cjp-founder-abhijeet-dipke-as-protest-continues-at-jantar-mantar/articleshow/132476641.cms", "headline": "Video: Woman hurls ink at CJP founder Abhijeet Dipke as protest continues at Jantar Mantar"}, {"source": "OpIndia", "owner": "OpIndia", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.opindia.com/2026/07/delhi-police-takes-sonam-wangchuk-to-hospital-abhijeet-dipke-cjp-lies-about-abduction-detention-physical-assault-explained", "headline": "Sonam Wangchuk hospitalised but CJP falsely claims ‘abduction’ to unknown location, Abhijeet Dipke lies about being detained: Here is what happened so far"}, {"source": "The Quint", "owner": "The Quint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "CJP Founder Dipke Goes On Hunger Strike After Cops Take Wangchuk TO hospital"}, {"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.